Danger. Danger.

01:50:50.870 --> 01:50:53.560
The androids are still drilling!

01:51:31.240 --> 01:51:33.780
It's going down! What's going on here, Jack?!

01:52:06.810 --> 01:52:11.360
Jack. That's what I like to call "teledirect missiles."

01:53:09.150 --> 01:53:11.070
We're approaching the maximum speed.

01:53:11.070 --> 01:53:13.070
Jack, forget them, we're leaving.

01:53:13.070 --> 01:53:20.620
Maximum speed in 1.2 minutes.

01:53:20.620 --> 01:53:22.620
Stabilizing retractable rockets.

01:53:22.620 --> 01:53:24.620
On hold.

01:53:30.120 --> 01:53:32.520
I'm going to lock you up, you're going to make a long trip.

01:53:34.550 --> 01:53:44.820
What is that?

01:53:44.820 --> 01:53:47.410
It looks like the insects are forming a...

01:53:47.410 --> 01:53:49.360
A giant weapon.

01:53:52.300 --> 01:53:56.650
Alert.

01:53:56.650 --> 01:53:57.650
It's decoupling!

01:53:57.650 --> 01:53:58.700
What?

01:53:58.700 --> 01:54:00.000
What are you doing? We're following...

01:54:00.160 --> 01:54:02.160
The robots should not shoot that weapon.

01:54:02.160 --> 01:54:06.160
The probability of being hit at that speed is 1 in 325.

01:54:06.160 --> 01:54:08.160
I can't take that risk.

01:54:08.160 --> 01:54:10.160
But you'll never come back on time.

01:54:11.160 --> 01:54:12.340
Jack!

01:54:12.340 --> 01:54:19.340
I hit him!

01:54:19.340 --> 01:54:21.220
But what about Jack?

01:54:21.220 --> 01:54:22.880
Damn, there's no time left!

01:55:37.420 --> 01:55:38.260
Take off.

01:57:02.240 --> 01:57:04.000
To the past at home, I jack

01:57:04.000 --> 01:57:08.710
Past at home, I jack

01:57:08.710 --> 01:57:10.430
Jack, jack, jack, jack, jack

01:57:10.430 --> 01:57:11.270
Gotta do that

01:57:44.620 --> 01:58:00.000
A long time ago in a distant land, I, Aku, the angel of darkness, unleashed an indescribable evil, but a silly samurai warrior who softens a sword.

01:58:00.000 --> 01:58:11.660
magic decided to oppose me before the last blow opened a portal in

01:58:11.660 --> 01:58:19.730
time and send it to the future where my evil is the law now the fool

01:58:19.730 --> 01:58:29.800
try to go back to the past and get away from the future that I am

01:59:03.390 --> 01:59:04.230
Go!

02:00:00.190 --> 02:00:00.870
Let's go.

02:00:30.540 --> 02:00:33.020
Yes, I was waiting for you.

02:00:33.020 --> 02:00:34.540
I came for...

02:00:34.540 --> 02:00:36.540
Please, please, don't insult me.

02:00:36.540 --> 02:00:38.540
I know why you're here.

02:00:38.540 --> 02:00:40.370
Really?

02:00:40.370 --> 02:00:42.640
Of course.

02:00:42.640 --> 02:00:44.640
A lot of things in life are a mystery.

02:00:44.640 --> 02:00:46.640
But I know why you're here.

02:00:46.640 --> 02:00:48.820
I know you as a mother who knows her son.

02:00:48.820 --> 02:00:50.820
For example, if the child comes home crying,

02:00:50.820 --> 02:00:52.820
the mother knows why.

02:00:52.820 --> 02:00:54.900
So I know why you're here.

02:00:54.900 --> 02:00:58.900
Please, I'm here for something very important.

02:00:58.900 --> 02:01:00.000
Of course.

02:01:00.000 --> 02:01:04.000
I know. You've come here to look for what you can't find anywhere else.

02:01:04.000 --> 02:01:07.000
You're here to make your most intimate wish.

02:01:07.000 --> 02:01:12.000
You're here for what has been prepared through the times to take you home.

02:01:12.000 --> 02:01:14.180
Yes. Is she here?

02:01:14.180 --> 02:01:18.060
Of course! I want to introduce you to...

02:01:18.060 --> 02:01:21.060
King Basad's Aragiana carpet!

02:01:21.060 --> 02:01:22.060
What?

02:01:22.060 --> 02:01:25.060
Yes! I know that! It's very impressive!

02:01:25.060 --> 02:01:28.920
I'm sorry. I've come to the wrong place. I don't want to buy a carpet.

02:01:28.920 --> 02:01:30.000
What?

02:01:30.160 --> 02:01:32.470
I thought this was the place.

02:01:32.470 --> 02:01:34.480
- Wait, can I see that?

02:01:38.330 --> 02:01:41.230
The old Woollies' papyrus!

02:01:41.230 --> 02:01:44.380
- Yes, they said you could help me.

02:01:44.380 --> 02:01:48.320
- Of course, the Woollies are old friends.

02:01:48.320 --> 02:01:50.340
Why didn't you say it from the start?

02:01:50.340 --> 02:01:51.540
- I tried, but...

02:01:51.540 --> 02:01:53.680
- It doesn't matter, come quickly.

02:01:53.680 --> 02:01:57.120
I bet we don't have much time.

02:01:57.120 --> 02:02:00.000
There, you've done it.

02:02:00.510 --> 02:02:10.970
Sit down, there's nothing to fear.

02:02:12.250 --> 02:02:24.580
Put your hands in the light.

02:02:37.260 --> 02:02:40.260
The light has accepted you.

02:02:40.260 --> 02:02:44.310
A vision is forming.

02:02:44.310 --> 02:02:47.740
There is a strange structure.

02:02:47.740 --> 02:02:49.840
With a jewel inside.

02:02:49.840 --> 02:02:56.840
If that's what you're looking for, the jewel has great magic.

02:03:00.000 --> 02:03:00.800
What happened?

02:03:00.800 --> 02:03:03.000
A warning!

02:03:03.000 --> 02:03:08.000
Only the pure can approach and use the power of the jewel.

02:03:09.000 --> 02:03:13.000
My mission is noble, my heart is pure. I have nothing to fear.

02:03:13.000 --> 02:03:21.010
If you tell the truth, now follow the sun that is hidden and the rising moon.

02:03:21.010 --> 02:03:24.000
They will be your guide.

02:03:24.950 --> 02:03:27.540
Something is wrong.

02:03:27.540 --> 02:03:30.000
It's something wrong.

02:03:30.030 --> 02:03:32.030
Malignant

02:03:32.030 --> 02:03:33.910
I can't clearly see the image

02:03:38.610 --> 02:03:45.770
The master Aku will reward us very well for your destruction

02:03:48.330 --> 02:03:49.820
My sword!

02:04:31.920 --> 02:04:33.420
What are you looking at?

02:04:43.610 --> 02:04:47.050
Diablos.

02:04:47.050 --> 02:04:52.130
Yes, I know.

02:04:52.490 --> 02:04:54.670
No! You don't understand!

02:04:57.910 --> 02:04:59.560
It was time.

02:05:00.000 --> 02:05:03.230
I needed my sword

02:05:03.230 --> 02:05:10.120
Now I understand

02:05:10.120 --> 02:05:11.950
Who are you? Why did you help me?

02:05:11.950 --> 02:05:14.320
You're not very grateful, are you?

02:05:31.980 --> 02:05:32.980
Hurry up.

02:06:00.640 --> 02:06:03.290
Oh, class?

02:06:03.850 --> 02:06:05.150
Adorables, no crees.

02:06:13.530 --> 02:06:14.230
Hot, hot, hot.

02:06:15.230 --> 02:06:15.550
Hiya!

02:06:17.130 --> 02:06:18.630
No, hot, hot, hot.

02:06:20.160 --> 02:06:20.980
Hot, hot, hot.

02:06:22.680 --> 02:06:24.240
Hot, hot, hot.

02:06:45.320 --> 02:06:47.440
Who are you? Why did you help me?

02:06:47.440 --> 02:06:48.980
Don't thank me.

02:06:48.980 --> 02:07:00.000
My stay on this Earth

02:07:00.000 --> 02:07:01.960
It has become abrupt and rude.

02:07:01.960 --> 02:07:04.870
Forgive me. I did not mean to insult you.

02:07:04.870 --> 02:07:07.340
It was not so serious, Samurai.

02:07:07.340 --> 02:07:07.810
Jack.

02:07:07.810 --> 02:07:08.580
What?

02:07:08.580 --> 02:07:10.080
Samurai Jack.

02:07:10.080 --> 02:07:12.610
That's how people call me from this place.

02:07:12.610 --> 02:07:14.630
Okay.

02:07:14.630 --> 02:07:18.080
Then let's look for a refuge, Jack.

02:07:18.080 --> 02:07:19.810
The night is not for riding.

02:07:38.670 --> 02:07:42.000
Don't worry, they're harmless.

02:08:00.030 --> 02:08:06.120
Hahahaha

02:08:06.120 --> 02:08:14.150
I am Ikra

02:08:14.150 --> 02:08:18.490
I came to this place not to save you

02:08:18.490 --> 02:08:20.520
But to save my father

02:08:20.520 --> 02:08:29.860
You will see, many moons ago, my father

02:08:30.060 --> 02:08:32.070
A great warrior

02:08:32.070 --> 02:08:36.120
He faced our master and lord, the tyrant Akko

02:08:36.120 --> 02:08:39.120
But Akko was too powerful

02:08:39.120 --> 02:08:43.120
And he wanted to give my father an exemplary punishment

02:08:43.120 --> 02:08:49.030
He caught him in a ring of fire where he will be a prisoner for all eternity

02:08:49.030 --> 02:08:52.030
To pay for the crime he had committed against Akko

02:08:52.030 --> 02:08:56.070
Legend has it that in some part of this desert

02:08:56.070 --> 02:09:00.000
Is hidden a magical jewel of great power

02:09:00.030 --> 02:09:04.950
power big enough to free my father

02:09:04.950 --> 02:09:10.130
creature of that store is the last survivor of an old race of

02:09:10.130 --> 02:09:16.120
desert inhabitants only he knows where is the jewel

02:09:16.120 --> 02:09:22.460
I've been looking for it for five years now with the chaos we have caused

02:09:22.460 --> 02:09:28.800
I'm afraid it will take me another five years to find it if I do it

02:09:30.760 --> 02:09:34.170
It is more than a coincidence that our paths have crossed.

02:09:34.170 --> 02:09:35.130
What?

02:09:35.130 --> 02:09:39.400
Yes, Aku's evil is my curse too.

02:09:39.400 --> 02:09:44.150
But I trust that together we will have the power to defeat that demon.

02:09:44.150 --> 02:09:46.610
Aku's henchmen arrived late.

02:09:46.610 --> 02:09:50.350
The ancient inhabitant of the desert told me how to find the all-powerful jewel.

02:09:50.350 --> 02:09:51.550
No...

02:09:51.550 --> 02:09:54.310
Yes, we will look for that jewel.

02:09:54.310 --> 02:10:00.000
When we find it, we will use its power to save your father and send me back in time to destroy Aku.

02:10:00.030 --> 02:10:03.970
and reverse the years that with their tyranny have besieged these lands.

02:10:03.970 --> 02:10:08.000
Look! The moon is rising, the path is drawn,

02:10:08.000 --> 02:10:14.080
our moment is now, where we have failed as individuals, together we will be victorious.

02:14:35.600 --> 02:14:36.600
Is this a mirage?

02:14:36.600 --> 02:14:37.600
It could be...

02:14:37.600 --> 02:14:39.640
We have traveled very far.

02:14:39.640 --> 02:14:53.020
I feel like we are close.

02:14:53.020 --> 02:14:58.610
Water!

02:15:07.160 --> 02:15:11.610
Our search has ended.

02:15:11.610 --> 02:15:19.230
The Jewel.

02:15:19.230 --> 02:15:23.510
My stay in this miserable land dominated by Aku has finally ended.

02:15:23.510 --> 02:15:30.000
Magic Jewel, we have traveled through your desert, we have overcome every dangerous obstacle, we have been dazzled

02:15:30.000 --> 02:15:35.610
his magnificent beauty we have gained his respect now we humbly request

02:15:35.610 --> 02:15:47.150
use your power fulfill our destiny the sorcerer told me about this only

02:15:47.150 --> 02:15:52.920
someone with a pure heart can use the power of the jewel is testing us

02:16:03.740 --> 02:16:08.360
Something is wrong.

02:16:08.360 --> 02:16:12.770
They have deceived us.

02:16:12.770 --> 02:16:13.810
No!

02:16:13.810 --> 02:16:17.060
There must be some mistake. We are pure-hearted.

02:16:17.060 --> 02:16:19.170
I will not fight.

02:16:38.920 --> 02:16:41.100
Are you able to fly?

02:16:41.100 --> 02:16:43.620
Yes, and much more.

02:16:51.610 --> 02:16:53.040
What's going on?

02:17:13.560 --> 02:17:16.530
The jewel! We have achieved it!

02:17:16.530 --> 02:17:21.090
Finally, my long search has come to an end.

02:17:34.030 --> 02:17:34.950
What have you done?

02:17:46.300 --> 02:17:51.590
What was that?

02:17:52.000 --> 02:17:54.790
Not so much!

02:17:54.790 --> 02:17:56.610
It's me!

02:17:56.610 --> 02:17:59.000
Aku...

02:18:01.720 --> 02:18:08.710
Yes, Samurai, I have betrayed you. Ikra and I are the same person.

02:18:08.710 --> 02:18:10.210
No!

02:18:10.210 --> 02:18:14.850
Oh, yes. You see, I had a dream.

02:18:14.850 --> 02:18:22.620
No! A nightmare about a jewel that had the power to return you to the past.

02:18:22.620 --> 02:18:29.030
I knew it wasn't just a dream, but a premonition.

02:18:30.000 --> 02:18:37.570
He had to destroy this powerful jewel, but he didn't know where it was.

02:18:37.570 --> 02:18:39.540
No...

02:18:39.540 --> 02:18:44.380
Yes, Samurai, I knew you would find it.

02:18:44.380 --> 02:18:50.380
Oh, my poor father trapped in a ring of fire by the evil of Aku.

02:18:53.160 --> 02:18:57.490
Dumbass!

02:19:01.690 --> 02:19:03.540
Fight me, coward!

02:19:03.540 --> 02:19:05.520
Soon we will fight.

02:19:05.520 --> 02:19:11.020
But not until I have found the way to defeat you and your sword.

02:19:11.020 --> 02:19:13.880
Now, what did you say?

02:19:13.880 --> 02:19:14.880
Oh yes!

02:19:14.880 --> 02:19:22.870
Your stay in this miserable land, dominated by Aku, continues!

02:19:37.160 --> 02:19:40.170
I will destroy you, Aku.

02:19:40.170 --> 02:19:43.080
I swear.

02:20:00.350 --> 02:20:01.910
I say I'm all right, Jack.

02:20:37.070 --> 02:20:40.750
A long time ago, in a distant land...

02:20:40.750 --> 02:20:44.150
I, Aku, the Lord of Darkness...

02:20:44.150 --> 02:20:47.890
unleashed an indescribable evil!

02:20:47.890 --> 02:20:51.090
But a stupid samurai warrior...

02:20:51.090 --> 02:20:53.720
who softens a magic sword...

02:20:53.720 --> 02:20:56.660
decided to oppose me!

02:21:00.380 --> 02:21:10.290
Before the last blow, I opened a portal in time and sent it to the future, where my evil is the law.

02:21:10.290 --> 02:21:17.550
Now, the fool is trying to go back to the past and get away from the future that I am!

02:21:17.550 --> 02:21:19.410
Aku!

02:21:30.730 --> 02:21:31.670
to the pastime.

02:27:36.490 --> 02:27:40.740
I was the only survivor.

02:27:40.740 --> 02:27:47.070
My robot army was totally annihilated!

02:27:47.070 --> 02:27:51.000
In my dreams I still see the arrows that fall!

02:27:51.000 --> 02:27:53.700
Oh, rain...

02:27:53.700 --> 02:27:58.410
What does that tower have that made you sacrifice an entire army?

02:27:58.410 --> 02:27:59.820
A treasure?

02:28:00.440 --> 02:28:02.970
Gold? Rubies?

02:28:02.970 --> 02:28:09.560
Bah! It's not something of material value like a treasure!

02:28:09.560 --> 02:28:13.560
On the top of the tower there is a mystical well.

02:28:13.560 --> 02:28:18.210
The well of King Oserik!

02:28:18.210 --> 02:28:24.210
Those who arrive at the famous well are granted a wish.

02:28:24.210 --> 02:28:27.740
Their greatest wish.

02:28:27.740 --> 02:28:30.000
I'm from the throne of Gran Kahn!

02:28:30.120 --> 02:28:32.320
What are you doing? Telling stories again?

02:28:32.420 --> 02:28:35.020
Go clean the roof! I'll throw you off the edge!

02:28:35.150 --> 02:28:36.310
Failed!

02:28:42.380 --> 02:28:52.280
Excuse me, is that place you were talking about real?

02:28:52.280 --> 02:28:53.600
Of course!

02:28:53.700 --> 02:28:57.920
To tell the truth, now we're passing by him!

02:28:58.490 --> 02:28:59.540
There!

02:29:01.950 --> 02:29:10.430
At the center of that island, wrapped in the fog, is the treasure of King Oserik.

02:29:10.430 --> 02:29:13.870
Thank you very much.

02:29:13.870 --> 02:29:20.200
You should reconsider it.

02:29:20.200 --> 02:29:25.580
There are only three archers, but they decimated my entire army.

02:29:25.580 --> 02:29:28.160
You're just a man.

02:29:28.160 --> 02:29:29.960
Do the math.

02:29:34.280 --> 02:29:35.780
That way I could go home.

02:29:35.780 --> 02:29:39.560
There are other ways to go home.

02:29:39.560 --> 02:29:40.760
Not for me.

02:31:07.230 --> 02:31:08.160
Come back.

02:35:19.580 --> 02:35:22.340
This is useless, no one can fight like this.

02:35:22.340 --> 02:35:30.000
A great warrior is in tune with all his senses.

02:35:30.640 --> 02:35:39.840
Only then will you be able to expand your consciousness to be able to fight at any level.

02:35:39.840 --> 02:35:42.580
Try it again.

02:35:42.580 --> 02:35:48.050
Yes Sifu, I must fight at your level.

02:38:24.250 --> 02:38:25.220
I'm ready.

02:41:00.480 --> 02:41:04.460
No! Where... where am I?

02:41:04.460 --> 02:41:05.460
What?

02:41:05.460 --> 02:41:08.010
I can see!

02:41:08.010 --> 02:41:10.180
We're cured.

02:41:10.180 --> 02:41:15.560
How is that possible?

02:41:15.560 --> 02:41:20.880
You canceled our curse! We thank you!

02:41:20.880 --> 02:41:27.150
I came to ask for a wish in this well.

02:41:27.150 --> 02:41:29.000
The well is yours.

02:42:00.000 --> 02:42:01.760
The end will be rewarded.

02:42:01.760 --> 02:42:06.970
Oh, mystical well, humbly I desire...

02:42:06.970 --> 02:42:09.190
Wait! We have to warn you.

02:42:09.190 --> 02:42:11.840
Any wish granted has a price.

02:42:11.840 --> 02:42:16.560
We have been fighting for a long time and we strive to reach this well.

02:42:16.560 --> 02:42:21.150
When we get there, we stand in front of it and we ask as a wish to be the greatest

02:42:21.150 --> 02:42:22.590
warriors in the world.

02:42:22.590 --> 02:42:26.600
The spirit of the well actually made us great warriors,

02:42:26.600 --> 02:42:30.000
but by doing so, it deprived us of our sight and minds.

02:42:30.000 --> 02:42:32.720
Slaughtering us as their personal guards.

02:42:33.340 --> 02:42:36.530
We have led a cursed existence until now.

02:42:36.530 --> 02:42:55.730
You evil of the well!

02:42:55.730 --> 02:42:58.760
You will not take possession of another innocent!

02:42:58.760 --> 02:43:00.000
WISH!

02:43:00.000 --> 02:43:03.080
No matter what you are, you're destroyed!

02:43:30.990 --> 02:43:32.990
"The greatest of the warriors"

02:43:33.410 --> 02:43:35.780
"A noble spirit"

02:43:35.780 --> 02:43:37.780
"What an incredible sacrifice"
